{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "void",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "VOID",
 "description": "VOID for the Digitone mk1 (OS 1.44): a macro-only WOB + PAN guest pack. One master page and one right-edge depth bar. A toggles the macro, D cycles six motion modes (DRIFT, SWAY, TURN, SPIN, RUSH, ORBIT) with different WOB and PAN depths/speeds, B/C/E/F/G/H edit the amount. The page draws one big, bold arrow whose head follows the PAN x / WOB y trajectory and whose heading is its velocity, so it turns while scrolling laterally. OFF: VOID scrolls on the 4 px dot lattice with the depth bar visible. State is stored per pattern in a second reserved MIDI track (CH 15, pattern+0x17E0, magic ESO5). The WOB+PAN audio engine is a namespaced void_wave fork of digiwave 4.0c, so VOID can coexist with XTAL. Requires core 4.0 and the ESOTERIKA page host; includes neither.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
